PN,31001
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FA meteorite that crashed through the
OL,8,Froof of a New Jersey home has been
OL,9,Ffound to contain the chemistry of the
OL,10,Fearly solar system and molecules
OL,11,Fcrucial for life as we know it.
OL,13,FOn July 17, 2024, people cross New
OL,14,FYork, New Jersey, Connecticut, Rhode
OL,15,FIsland and Pennsylvania reported
OL,16,Fseeing a fireball streaking across the
OL,17,Fsky during the daytime, some of whom
OL,18,Fheard a loud sonic boom.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31002
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FThe spectacle came from a space rock,
OL,8,Fweighing around one kilogramme, which
OL,9,Fzipped through Earth's atmosphere at a
OL,10,Fspeed of 32,000 miles per hour.
OL,12,FUnlike some meteorites, this space
OL,13,Frock was particularly fragile,
OL,14,Fbreaking apart about 22 miles above
OL,15,Fground, according to Newark Liberty
OL,16,FInternational Airport's Doppler
OL,17,Fweather radar, which detected a cloud
OL,18,Fof fragments.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FOnly one of those fragments was
OL,8,Frecovered, as it punched through the
OL,9,Fceiling of a master bedroom of a home
OL,10,Fin Hillsborough, New Jersey.
OL,12,FThe impact caused no injuries, and the
OL,13,Fhomeowners quickly put on disposable
OL,14,Fgloves and collected the black
OL,15,Ffragments and dust from the bed and
OL,16,Fcarpet using aluminium foil and glass
OL,17,Fjars.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FNow scientists have published detailed
OL,8,Fanalysis of the fragment, including of
OL,9,Fextraterrestrial amino acids ` often
OL,10,Fviewed as the building blocks of life,
OL,11,Fand, among other things, carbon.
OL,13,F"There are hundreds of amino acids in
OL,14,Fthis meteorite and the majority of
OL,15,Fthem do not occur naturally on Earth,"
OL,16,Fsaid the study's co-author Dr Danny
OL,17,FGlavin, a senior Nasa scientist.
OL,26,@uD@AOUwD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,F"The suite of amino acids in
OL,8,FHillsborough was even more diverse
OL,9,Fthan those found in pristine samples
OL,10,Freturned from the carbon-rich
OL,11,Fasteroids Bennu and Ryugu," he wrote
OL,12,Fin an email.
OL,14,FDr Galvin added: "Most of the amino
OL,15,Facids detected in Hillsborough are
OL,16,Frare or non-existent in life on Earth,
OL,17,Fso they are truly extraterrestrial in
OL,18,Forigin."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@[O]vD@ROUzD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31006
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FA detailed analysis of the
OL,8,FHillsborough meteorite showed it was a
OL,9,FCM-type carbonaceous chondrite.
OL,11,FThe C stands for carbonaceous, while
OL,12,Fthe M signifies the Mighei meteorite,
OL,13,Fa carbonaceous chondrite that fell in
OL,14,FUkraine in 1889.
OL,16,FThese space rocks are remnants of
OL,17,Frocky bodies that were streaking
OL,18,Faround during the early days of the
OL,19,Fsolar system and contain hydrated
OL,20,Fminerals and organic compounds.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31007
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FPrimitive carbonaceous chondrites are
OL,8,Fbelieved to be the type of space rocks
OL,9,Fthat collided with early Earth and
OL,10,Fdelivered organic matter.
OL,12,FThe Hillsborough meteorite "provides
OL,13,Fmore evidence that meteorite delivery
OL,14,Fof organic matter to the early Earth
OL,15,Fcould have been an important source of
OL,16,Forganic molecules necessary for the
OL,17,Forigin of life," Dr Glavin said.
OL,26,@tD@\OUyD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31008
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FThere are two types of primitive CM
OL,8,Fmeteorites ` CM1 and CM2 ` the biggest
OL,9,Fdifference between them being how much
OL,10,Fwater altered their composition while
OL,11,Fthey were attached to a larger
OL,12,Fasteroid.
OL,14,FThe researchers classified the
OL,15,FHillsborough meteorite as a CM\ since
OL,16,Fit exists as an intermediate between
OL,17,Fthe two types.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31009
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FThe sample marks only the second time
OL,8,Fa CM\ meteorite has been witnessed
OL,9,Ffalling to Earth, noted Peter
OL,10,FJenniskens, the lead author of the
OL,11,Fstudy, published Wednesday in the
OL,12,FScience Advances journal.
OL,14,FIt is the first one that researchers
OL,15,Fhave been able to study in such a
OL,16,Fpristine sample.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31010
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,F"It is the first CM type meteorite
OL,8,Fthat contained bits of rock that
OL,9,Fpreserved the subsurface of the
OL,10,Foriginal asteroid," Jenniskens wrote
OL,11,Fin an email.
OL,13,F"We really have a unique window here
OL,14,Fon the physical properties of the
OL,15,Fparent asteroid."
OL,17,FThe Hillsborough meteorite may have
OL,18,Fonce belonged to a larger space rock
OL,19,Forbiting within the inner asteroid
OL,20,Fbelt, located between the orbits of
OL,21,FMars and Jupiter.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@SO]uD@AOUwD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31011
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,F"Some time ago, a significant asteroid
OL,8,Ffamily was formed in a large collision
OL,9,Fand some 6 million years ago a smaller
OL,10,Fcollision destroyed one of these
OL,11,Fasteroids, from which a piece ended up
OL,12,Fin near-Earth orbit," Jenniskens wrote.
OL,14,F"That piece experienced heat/cold
OL,15,Fcycles from spinning in the sunlight
OL,16,Fand fragmented about 200,000 years
OL,17,Fago. Then it still took that long to
OL,18,Fhit the small target of Earth."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@UO]vD@AOUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31012
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FResearchers detected high abundances
OL,8,Fof sodium, likely from icy brines
OL,9,Fwithin the original asteroid.
OL,11,FAs water evaporated on the space rock,
OL,12,Fit left behind concentrated salt
OL,13,Fminerals that could create molecules
OL,14,Fcrucial for life as we know it,
OL,15,Faccording to the researchers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31013
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FThe discovery of brine on the asteroid
OL,8,Fis key, said Peter Brown, professor in
OL,9,Fthe department of physics and
OL,10,Fastronomy at Western University in
OL,11,FLondon, Ontario, who was not involved
OL,12,Fin the study.
OL,14,FHe described this discovery as a kind
OL,15,Fof a leftover "of percolating water or
OL,16,Fice."
OL,26,@wD@OOUxD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31014
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FThe brine "is a really strong sort of
OL,8,Findicator of how water has moved,
OL,9,Fevolved and in particular how it's
OL,10,Freacted with organics," he told ITV
OL,11,FNews' North American partner CNN.
OL,13,F"Everything we can learn about how
OL,14,Fwater changes this kind of primitive
OL,15,Fmeteorite is super important to sort
OL,16,Fof astrobiology and early biology on
OL,17,FEarth."
OL,26,@oD@KOUrD@WO]uD@AOUyD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31015
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FWater may have been preserved beneath
OL,8,Fthe surface of the Hillsborough
OL,9,Fmeteorite's parent asteroid for an
OL,10,Fextended period, he added.
OL,12,FProf Brown said meteorites such as the
OL,13,FHillsborough one contain the chemistry
OL,14,Fof the early solar system because,
OL,15,Fwhile modified by water, they haven't
OL,16,Fendured much heating.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31016
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FHolding it would feel more like soil
OL,8,For clay that falls apart, rather than
OL,9,Fa solid rock, which reflects its lack
OL,10,Fof exposure to heat and a higher
OL,11,Fchance of preserving a snapshot of how
OL,12,Fwater interacted with minerals and
OL,13,Forganic matter, he added.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31017
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,FThe swift actions of the homeowners in
OL,8,FHillsborough enabled the detection of
OL,9,Fthe brine and other valuable compounds
OL,10,Fin the first place.
OL,12,FThe couple quickly got in touch with
OL,13,Fstudy co-author Mike Hankey at the
OL,14,FAmerican Meteor Society, who guided
OL,15,Fthem through preserving the sample and
OL,16,Fminimising contamination.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31018
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,F"We knew almost immediately that what
OL,8,Fhappened to us was incredibly rare and
OL,9,Fwe felt a responsibility to preserve
OL,10,Fthe meteorite for the scientific
OL,11,Fcommunity," the homeowners, who wished
OL,12,Fto remain anonymous, said.
OL,14,F"It's still surreal to think that this
OL,15,Fmeteorite travelled through space for
OL,16,Fmillions of years before ending its
OL,17,Fjourney in our home.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@KO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31019
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786846704
OL,3,CMeteorite that crashed through
OL,4,Ccouple's roof contains building blocks
OL,5,Cof life
OL,7,F"The entire experience has been
OL,8,Fincredible, and we're honoured to have
OL,9,Fplayed a small part in advancing
OL,10,Fscientific understanding through its
OL,11,Fstudy."
OL,13,FFragments of the Hillsborough
OL,14,Fmeteorite are being curated at the
OL,15,FAmerican Museum for Natural History in
OL,16,FNew York City.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/19
